<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh Jan-Apr 97 industry output up 2.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh Jan-Apr 97 industry output up 2.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's industrial production in January-April this year rose 2.4 percent compared to the same period last year, and totalled 261 billion tenge, a report from the National Statistics Agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKHSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-Apr '97	Jan-Apr '96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	   +2.4		 +0.4</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
